<title>USA: Envirometrics stock, warrants delisted.</title>
<headline>Envirometrics stock, warrants delisted.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLESTON, S.C. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Envirometrics Inc said its common stock and warrants will be delisted from the Nasdaq SmallCap Market, effective December 3.</p>
<p>Nasdaq delisted the stock because the company did not comply with Nasdaq's capital and surplus requirements, the company said.</p>
<p>The stock may continue to be listed in the OTC-Bulletin Board, the company added.</p>
<p>Envirometrics said it is now looking for a capital infusion that would help its stock meet Nasdaq's listing criteria.</p>
</text>
